  "content": "<a href=\"/\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M257.5 445.1l-22.2 22.2c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L7 273c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L201.4 44.7c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.2 22.2c9.5 9.5 9.3 25-.4 34.3L136.6 216H424c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v32c0 13.3-10.7 24-24 24H136.6l120.5 114.8c9.8 9.3 10 24.8.4 34.3z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBack\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t<p>Project &gt;</p><p>Arvenia Shop Website</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Arvenia Shop Website</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Project Overview: </b>Arvenia Shop is a specialized e-commerce platform designed for selling digital assets. Unlike traditional stores, the challenge was to create an instant, secure delivery system for digital goods while building a community through membership. I engineered this solution using a <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0\" data-index-in-node=\"277\">No-Code stack (WordPress + WooCommerce)</b> to ensure rapid deployment and ease of maintenance for the client.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Challenge: </b>The client needed a platform to sell digital products with restricted access. The main pain points were managing user permissions manually and creating a seamless \"buy-to-download\" flow without friction.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Solution (Solusi Teknis):</b></p><blockquote data-path-to-node=\"16\"><ul data-path-to-node=\"16,0\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Automated Access Control:</b> Integrated <b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"37\">Ultimate Member</b> with <b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">WooCommerce</b> logic. Once a user purchases a product, their profile is automatically upgraded to access specific content areas</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom UI/UX:</b> Although built with <b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"34\">Elementor Pro</b>, I applied custom CSS and design principles to break away from generic templates, ensuring the brand identity stood out.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">SEO Optimization:</b> Implemented <b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">Rank Math</b> schemas to ensure products rank high on search engines for organic traffic.</p></li></ul></blockquote><p data-path-to-node=\"17\"> </p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🔗Live Site</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://arvenia.shop/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLink\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"19e1270\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"25\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwMCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzI1LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjE5ZTEyNzAifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/25.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/25.png\" alt=\"25\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"19e1270\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"26\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwMSwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzI2LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjE5ZTEyNzAifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/26.png\" alt=\"26\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"19e1270\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"27\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwMiwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzI3LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjE5ZTEyNzAifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/27.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/27.png\" alt=\"27\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"19e1270\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"28\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwMywidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzI4LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjE5ZTEyNzAifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/28.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/28.png\" alt=\"28\" /></figure></a><a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"19e1270\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"29\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTgwNCwidXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6XC9cL2toYWlyYW4udGVjaFwvd3AtY29udGVudFwvdXBsb2Fkc1wvMjAyNVwvMTFcLzI5LnBuZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjE5ZTEyNzAifQ%3D%3D\" href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/29.png\"><figure><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/29.png\" alt=\"29\" /></figure></a>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p data-path-to-node=\"17\"><b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Result: </b>A fully automated digital store where users can register, pay, and access downloads instantly without admin intervention.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🧩 <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"407\">Topic Area</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDigital E-commerce\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMembership Integration\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tProduct Digital\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tProductivity &amp; Finance\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWordPress CMS + Elementor Pro\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tWooCommerce + Payment Gateway\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tRank Math SEO\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tUltimate Member Integration + Social Login\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tResponsive Web Design\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>⭐ Key Features</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li><p><b>Streamlined Checkout Process</b>: A secure and frictionless checkout flow optimized for digital product purchases.</p></li><li><p><b>Intuitive User Dashboard</b>: A unified \"My Account\" area where users can manage profiles, view order history, and access digital downloads.</p></li><li><p><b>Seamless Social Login</b>: Provides quick and easy registration and login through Google, boosting user acquisition.</p></li><li><p><b>Optimized for Mobile</b>: A fully responsive design ensuring a consistent and engaging experience across all devices.</p></li></ul>"
}